cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "coherence²: blind synchronisation for asynchronous multimodal audio capture"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chakraborty
    given-names: Ashmita
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-5506-9588"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dhwaani/CoherenceSquared"
abstract: >-
  Blind sampling-rate-offset estimation between an air microphone and a
  body-conduction sensor running on independent clocks. Existing estimators from
  the wireless acoustic sensor network literature assume a time-invariant
  inter-channel transfer function; in multimodal capture that transfer function
  is signal-dependent, which costs the estimator its consistency. This work
  characterises the failure and proposes conditioning coherence accumulation on
  latent signal class.
keywords:
  - sampling rate offset
  - blind synchronisation
  - bone conduction
  - own voice detection
  - coherence
  - embedded audio
license: GNU/GPL
